<title>JAPAN: Shikoku Coca-Cola - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Shikoku Coca-Cola - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 52.32		vs	   49.15</p>
<p> Operating	    3.84		vs	    3.64</p>
<p> Current		4.38		vs	    4.11</p>
<p> Net		    2.11		vs	    2.14</p>
<p> EPS		   94.88 yen	  vs	   97.81 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 80.68 yen	  vs	   79.51 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shikoku Coca-Cola Bottling Co Ltd is a Coca-Cola bottler covering the Shikoku market.</p>
